{
  "summary": "Michael Scopes (Paper-Co Regional Manager) reports Stock-Track-360 crashes since Nov 14, causing 22 reports in 48h. Manual tracking missed 8 shipments. Tier 1 support suggested clearing cache (unhelpful). Requires senior dev remote fix today; else switch vendors in 24h."
}

